<header id="title-block-header" class="quarto-title-block default">
<div class="quarto-title">
<h1 class="title">Current and recent research</h1>
<p class="subtitle lead">I lead the research group <a href="https://egon.stats.ucl.ac.uk/research/statistics-health-economics/">Statistics for Health Economic Evaluation</a> at UCL and my research is a blend of methodological and applied work. My main areas of interests are statistical modelling for health economic evaluation, causal inference from non-experimental data and Bayesian modelling in general.</p>
</div>



<div class="quarto-title-meta column-page-left">

    
  
    
  </div>
  


</header>






